          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-green-700">
            <li>• High satisfaction scores (4.5+ average)</li>
            <li>• Strong completion rates</li>
            <li>• Consistent positive feedback</li>
            <li>• Growing response volume</li>
          </ul>
